WEBVTT

00:13.994 --> 00:16.404
<b>What are you doing out here?</b>

00:18.584 --> 00:20.914
<b>Listening to the sound of the waves.</b>

00:21.984 --> 00:23.854
<b>You were just listening?</b>

00:24.524 --> 00:25.584
<b>Not looking?</b>

00:26.084 --> 00:27.204
<b>Because...</b>

00:28.254 --> 00:29.754
<b>I can't see them, right?</b>

00:31.654 --> 00:34.714
<b>Then why not come during the day?</b>

00:35.404 --> 00:37.904
<b>I'd rather do that.</b>

00:37.904 --> 00:40.224
<b>But they'd find me if I did.</b>

00:41.184 --> 00:43.724
<b>More importantly, who are you?</b>

00:44.084 --> 00:46.174
<b>I don't think we've met.</b>

00:47.054 --> 00:49.634
<b>I was just brought here recently.</b>

00:49.984 --> 00:52.084
<b>Some stuff happened, you see.</b>

00:52.854 --> 00:54.374
<b>I see.</b>

00:54.374 --> 00:55.984
<b>What's your name?</b>

00:57.644 --> 01:02.034
<b>The grown-ups call me #602.</b>

01:21.834 --> 01:22.814
<b>Nagisa.</b>

01:25.924 --> 01:29.494
<b>Since you love the sea, 
that's what I'll call you.</b>

01:30.944 --> 01:32.724
<b>What's your name?</b>

01:32.724 --> 01:34.634
<b>I don't have a name.</b>

01:35.184 --> 01:36.414
<b>But...</b>

01:36.414 --> 01:37.524
<b>What?</b>

01:38.234 --> 01:40.294
<b>I have a code name, I guess.</b>

03:18.004 --> 03:20.964
EPISODE 1: TO SEE YOU ONCE MORE

03:18.384 --> 03:20.434
<b>Where am I?</b>

03:31.594 --> 03:33.474
<b>What was that for, Natsunagi?</b>

03:33.474 --> 03:35.614
<b>That's my line!</b>

03:35.614 --> 03:38.604
<b>Don't try to kiss your classmate 
when she's asleep!</b>

03:39.464 --> 03:41.094
<b>This isn't fair.</b>

03:41.094 --> 03:44.364
<b>You two are being very loud.</b>

03:44.734 --> 03:46.364
<b>Saikawa?</b>

03:46.794 --> 03:48.614
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

03:49.164 --> 03:53.154
<b>Hmm? You want to know why 
I'm sleeping next to you, Kimizuka-san?</b>

03:53.154 --> 03:55.374
<b>You're asking me?</b>

03:55.374 --> 03:58.444
<b>Why are you saying it like that?</b>

03:58.444 --> 04:00.874
<b>I didn't bring you here, did I?</b>

04:00.874 --> 04:03.634
<b>You really don't remember?</b>

04:03.634 --> 04:04.704
<b>Char?!</b>

04:05.144 --> 04:10.514
<b>We were going to visit Ma'am's grave when 
someone kidnapped us and brought us here.</b>

04:11.264 --> 04:12.534
<b>That's right!</b>

04:12.534 --> 04:14.144
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

04:14.144 --> 04:18.394
<b>Hmph. You guys are so quick 
to let your guard down.</b>

04:18.394 --> 04:20.524
<b>You were kidnapped too, right?</b>

04:20.524 --> 04:22.654
<b>Jeez! Fine! I'm sorry!</b>

04:34.304 --> 04:40.004
<b><i>If you're seeing this video, it means...</i></b>

04:40.004 --> 04:41.874
<b><i>that Kimizuka Kimihiko,</i></b>

04:41.874 --> 04:43.504
<b><i>Natsunagi Nagisa,</i></b>

04:43.834 --> 04:45.254
<b><i>Saikawa Yui,</i></b>

04:45.254 --> 04:47.504
<b><i>and Charlotte Arisaka Anderson</i></b>

04:47.504 --> 04:49.834
<b><i>are all in the room.</i></b>

04:50.944 --> 04:52.514
<b>Siesta—</b>

04:51.374 --> 04:52.514
<b>Ma'am!</b>

04:52.924 --> 04:55.194
<b><i>It's been a while, Char.</i></b>

04:55.194 --> 04:56.494
<b><i>But I'm sorry.</i></b>

04:56.494 --> 05:01.774
<b><i>I recorded this video a year ago, 
knowing this day would come.</i></b>

05:02.434 --> 05:03.404
<b>Ma'am...</b>

05:04.444 --> 05:07.654
<b>So this is Siesta-san?</b>

05:07.654 --> 05:12.244
<b><i>Now, there's a reason I brought you all here.</i></b>

05:12.744 --> 05:15.664
<b><i>It's about time you learn...</i></b>

05:15.664 --> 05:18.874
<b><i>what happened to me a year ago.</i></b>

05:20.044 --> 05:22.204
<b>What happened?</b>

05:23.714 --> 05:29.484
<b><i>I want you to see what happened to us...</i></b>

05:29.484 --> 05:31.554
<b><i>and the truth of my death.</i></b>

05:31.834 --> 05:33.804
<b><i>And then...</i></b>

05:34.344 --> 05:36.234
<b><i>I want you to decide.</i></b>

05:39.144 --> 05:45.194
<b><i>And thus began a retelling of 
the three years I spent with Siesta.</i></b>

05:46.804 --> 05:50.694
<b><i>We met 10,000 meters above the surface 
of the Earth aboard a hijacked airplane</i></b>

05:50.694 --> 05:53.854
<b><i>and embarked on a series 
of incredible adventures.</i></b>

05:54.864 --> 05:58.374
<b><i>And then, as we battled 
the secret organization SPES,</i></b>

05:58.374 --> 06:00.484
<b><i>we met a strange girl named Alicia.</i></b>

06:01.024 --> 06:06.004
<b><i>But there was a personality inside her, 
"Hel," that even she didn't know about.</i></b>

06:07.024 --> 06:09.384
<b><i>And then we headed to the enemy's hideout,</i></b>

06:09.904 --> 06:13.554
<b><i>to follow Hel, or perhaps save Alicia.</i></b>

06:14.094 --> 06:16.894
<b><i>There we met Seed, the enemy's leader.</i></b>

06:17.764 --> 06:21.994
<b><i>And Siesta began 
her final battle with Hel.</i></b>

06:23.264 --> 06:26.594
<b><i>What happened on that island, 
one year ago?</i></b>

06:26.994 --> 06:29.614
<b><i>Why is the detective already dead?</i></b>

06:31.114 --> 06:32.414
<b><i>They...</i></b>

06:33.264 --> 06:35.124
<b><i>She... learned.</i></b>

06:35.614 --> 06:39.964
<b><i>The one who took Siesta's life 
on that day, in that place...</i></b>

06:39.964 --> 06:41.224
<b>It was me.</b>

06:44.004 --> 06:46.344
<b>I killed Siesta-san...</b>

06:47.904 --> 06:51.394
<b>I took the person you cared for most...</b>

06:52.144 --> 06:53.214
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

06:53.534 --> 06:56.074
<b>No, you didn't do anything.</b>

06:56.074 --> 06:57.694
<b>It wasn't you...</b>

06:57.694 --> 06:59.254
<b>It was another...</b>

06:59.974 --> 07:03.184
<b>I didn't just get a heart transplant.</b>

07:03.184 --> 07:06.734
<b>I stole Siesta-san's heart.</b>

07:07.524 --> 07:11.374
<b>And the memories of my youth 
and all that time in the hospital...</b>

07:11.374 --> 07:15.864
<b>were because of the memories 
from that time at SPES...</b>

07:18.454 --> 07:20.974
<b><i>Natsunagi learned everything.</i></b>

07:20.974 --> 07:22.504
<b><i>She remembered.</i></b>

07:23.244 --> 07:28.864
<b><i>Alicia and the girl 
called Hel were both her.</i></b>

07:29.634 --> 07:33.724
<b>You lost your memories 
because of that pollen?</b>

07:33.724 --> 07:36.384
<b>Both Nagisa and Kimizuka were affected?</b>

07:36.684 --> 07:39.934
<b>You remembered the whole time, right, Char?</b>

07:39.934 --> 07:40.764
<b>Yes...</b>

07:40.764 --> 07:42.254
<b>Char-san, I...</b>

07:42.254 --> 07:43.564
<b>Don't say a word.</b>

07:44.324 --> 07:47.484
<b>I know it's not your fault.</b>

07:47.484 --> 07:51.374
<b>But... I still want a little more time.</b>

07:52.704 --> 07:53.504
<b>Right.</b>

07:55.904 --> 07:57.084
<b>Everything's okay.</b>

07:57.084 --> 07:58.154
<b>Let's calm down.</b>

07:59.284 --> 08:00.834
<b>We can clasp our hands.</b>

08:00.834 --> 08:02.164
<b>Rotate our shoulders.</b>

08:02.164 --> 08:03.914
<b>Breathe rhythmically.</b>

08:04.224 --> 08:08.244
<b>Close our eyes, 
take a deep breath in, then out.</b>

08:08.244 --> 08:09.414
<b>Help our blood flow.</b>

08:09.914 --> 08:13.824
<b>Open our eyes, 
and watch our blurry vision clear.</b>

08:15.464 --> 08:16.924
<b>Saikawa...</b>

08:16.924 --> 08:20.844
<b>And when we've done that, 
why don't we all have some tea?</b>

08:21.584 --> 08:22.864
<b>Sheesh...</b>

08:22.864 --> 08:25.434
<b>Why are you the most grown-up of us all?</b>

08:27.904 --> 08:30.494
<b>A tea party? That sounds wonderful.</b>

08:30.494 --> 08:32.814
<b>I hope you'll allow me to join.</b>

08:36.694 --> 08:39.514
<b>The next time you try to touch this body,</b>

08:39.514 --> 08:42.004
<b>I'll shatter every bone in yours.</b>

08:42.004 --> 08:43.574
<b>That's not fair...</b>

08:46.644 --> 08:48.054
<b>You're...</b>

08:50.744 --> 08:52.104
<b>Siesta?</b>

09:02.544 --> 09:05.234
<b>Unfortunately, I don't have any tea cakes.</b>

09:05.234 --> 09:07.654
<b>Shall we have some delivered?</b>

09:07.654 --> 09:09.224
<b>Kimihiko will pay.</b>

09:09.224 --> 09:11.984
<b>Hey, don't be so mean to me.</b>

09:12.434 --> 09:16.104
<b>So, where have we been brought?</b>

09:16.104 --> 09:21.244
<b>This is one of Siesta-sama's hideouts.</b>

09:21.544 --> 09:23.324
<b>First I'm hearing of it...</b>

09:27.344 --> 09:30.304
<b>You really do look just like Ma'am...</b>

09:30.304 --> 09:32.964
<b>Charlotte, I'll say this again.</b>

09:32.964 --> 09:35.034
<b>I'm just a robot.</b>

09:35.454 --> 09:41.254
<b>A bio-android created from a portion 
of Siesta-sama's body, memories,</b>

09:41.254 --> 09:42.974
<b>and abilities before her death.</b>

09:43.414 --> 09:47.434
<b>The name she gave me was "Noches."</b>

09:48.064 --> 09:51.034
<b>It's hard to believe, 
but I guess I have to.</b>

09:51.034 --> 09:55.794
<b>The real one would've let me rest 
on her lap instead of flipping me.</b>

09:56.444 --> 09:59.094
<b>I have queried my database,</b>

09:59.094 --> 10:01.154
<b>and it appears that statement is false.</b>

10:01.154 --> 10:03.054
<b>Don't make it so obvious 
you're looking away.</b>

10:03.054 --> 10:06.324
<b>And if you're modeled on Siesta, 
then stop hating me.</b>

10:06.624 --> 10:11.694
<b>I dislike you <i>because</i> 
I'm modeled on Siesta-sama.</b>

10:11.694 --> 10:14.584
<b>I told you not to be so mean to me.</b>

10:14.584 --> 10:18.874
<b>Why does it sound like the two of them 
have been married for years?</b>

10:18.874 --> 10:21.224
<b>Yui, don't compare them to a couple.</b>

10:21.224 --> 10:22.844
<b>They're more like a veteran comedy duo.</b>

10:24.004 --> 10:25.654
<b>Listen, Noches.</b>

10:25.654 --> 10:28.944
<b>I understand that you're 
the one who kidnapped us.</b>

10:28.944 --> 10:31.474
<b>Which means you needed 
to talk to us, right?</b>

10:34.484 --> 10:39.994
<b>Siesta-sama made many preparations 
before that day.</b>

10:40.494 --> 10:45.614
<b>And I was given the duty 
of telling you the truth.</b>

10:47.864 --> 10:48.934
<b>Nagisa.</b>

10:49.874 --> 10:54.044
<b>It's because of you 
that Siesta-sama's will can be carried on.</b>

10:54.394 --> 10:58.664
<b>Ensuring that you survive 
and attend school</b>

10:58.664 --> 11:02.134
<b>was her last wish 
and the last job she gave me.</b>

11:02.944 --> 11:05.384
<b>So on her behalf, I say...</b>

11:06.944 --> 11:07.994
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:10.484 --> 11:11.994
<b>I...</b>

11:15.564 --> 11:19.774
<b>Why are you telling us about the past now?</b>

11:19.774 --> 11:23.284
<b>Why hide the truth until now?</b>

11:23.284 --> 11:25.334
<b>There are several reasons.</b>

11:25.654 --> 11:30.014
<b>The first being that Siesta-sama 
required a long period of time</b>

11:30.014 --> 11:35.234
<b>to suppress the evil "Hel" personality 
within Nagisa's body</b>

11:35.234 --> 11:37.664
<b>and stabilize Nagisa herself.</b>

11:38.254 --> 11:41.794
<b>And the second reason 
was that she was waiting</b>

11:41.794 --> 11:44.124
<b>for the four of you 
to truly come together.</b>

11:45.504 --> 11:49.184
<b>And the last reason is...</b>

11:49.874 --> 11:51.054
<b>Seed.</b>

11:52.384 --> 11:57.364
<b>Seed has taken no overt actions 
over the course of the last year.</b>

11:57.364 --> 12:02.064
<b>But it seems that's changed recently.</b>

12:02.394 --> 12:06.984
<b>Stopping them is your job, Nagisa.</b>

12:06.984 --> 12:09.074
<b>My job?</b>

12:09.414 --> 12:12.074
<b>It's not just Natsunagi's problem, right?</b>

12:12.534 --> 12:14.064
<b>That is correct.</b>

12:14.514 --> 12:21.464
<b>But her role is far greater 
than yours, Yui's, or Charlotte's.</b>

12:21.924 --> 12:25.844
<b>Because Nagisa is the Great Detective.</b>

12:27.594 --> 12:32.004
<b>That's right. 
Siesta-sama didn't tell you yet.</b>

12:32.544 --> 12:34.724
<b>Our "Great Detective" is—</b>

12:34.724 --> 12:35.724
<b>Wait!</b>

12:36.064 --> 12:40.354
<b>Another word and you'll violate 
the Federation Charter!</b>

12:40.734 --> 12:42.104
<b>I don't care.</b>

12:42.444 --> 12:45.674
<b>They're a part of this, too.</b>

12:50.204 --> 12:54.914
<b>The Great Detective is one of the Tuners,</b>

12:54.914 --> 12:57.294
<b>the twelve shields 
that protect this world.</b>

12:57.664 --> 12:59.044
<b>"Tuners"?</b>

12:59.044 --> 13:02.244
<b>There are dangers that arise 
throughout the world at regular intervals,</b>

13:02.244 --> 13:04.544
<b>many at the same time...</b>

13:05.164 --> 13:07.094
<b>And an international organization</b>

13:07.094 --> 13:10.754
<b>has secretly drafted in individuals
 to deal with them.</b>

13:11.224 --> 13:13.094
<b>The "Tuners."</b>

13:13.844 --> 13:16.204
<b>There are 12 in all.</b>

13:16.204 --> 13:18.004
<b>They all have different roles.</b>

13:18.004 --> 13:20.914
<b>The "Phantom Thief," 
"the Shrine Maiden," the "Assassin."</b>

13:20.914 --> 13:25.194
<b>It's said that one of them 
is even a vampire.</b>

13:25.454 --> 13:27.044
<b>A vampire?</b>

13:27.044 --> 13:31.444
<b>But a year ago, Siesta-sama passed away,</b>

13:31.934 --> 13:34.284
<b>and the role of the "Great Detective"</b>

13:34.284 --> 13:37.454
<b>whose job it is to destroy SPES 
became vacant.</b>

13:37.894 --> 13:44.414
<b>It's likely that you, Nagisa, will be 
designated the next Great Detective.</b>

13:45.134 --> 13:47.984
<b>Of course, it hasn't been decided yet.</b>

13:47.984 --> 13:51.604
<b>But you have the heart of 
the previous Great Detective,</b>

13:51.604 --> 13:53.844
<b>and you carry on her will.</b>

13:53.844 --> 13:58.914
<b>And you can master powers 
beyond those of a normal human.</b>

13:59.504 --> 14:04.104
<b>Many people will think that 
sufficient reason.</b>

14:04.394 --> 14:07.894
<b>Siesta won't appear 
inside her body anymore.</b>

14:07.894 --> 14:09.364
<b>I know.</b>

14:09.754 --> 14:13.754
<b>And so I ask you once more, on her behalf.</b>

14:14.434 --> 14:19.534
<b>Nagisa, will you truly carry on 
the will of the Great Detective?</b>

14:20.584 --> 14:22.044
<b>I...</b>

14:22.664 --> 14:27.664
<b>If... just hypothetically, 
she were to say yes,</b>

14:27.664 --> 14:29.314
<b>what should she do first?</b>

14:30.484 --> 14:31.744
<b>Hmm...</b>

14:35.024 --> 14:38.264
<b>Let's have her hunt for a mistake.</b>

14:42.324 --> 14:46.714
<b><i>If Natsunagi is unsure about 
becoming the Great Detective,</i></b>

14:47.124 --> 14:52.524
<b><i>she can first find a "mistake" in that 
footage from a year ago she saw yesterday</i></b>

14:52.524 --> 14:54.534
<b><i>and decide then.</i></b>

14:56.034 --> 14:58.214
<b><i>That's what Noches said.</i></b>

14:56.464 --> 14:58.404
<b>Wow, what's with that reaction?</b>

14:58.404 --> 14:59.534
<b>What's going on?</b>

14:58.984 --> 15:00.854
<b><i>And then she let us go.</i></b>

15:04.584 --> 15:08.294
<b>But we don't have any clues...</b>

15:19.134 --> 15:20.354
<b>You're kidding me.</b>

15:21.664 --> 15:25.994
<b>You ate lunch all alone, and then 
you've been sleeping here ever since?</b>

15:26.484 --> 15:29.164
<b>Lunch tastes better on the roof.</b>

15:29.164 --> 15:31.234
<b>That's not the point.</b>

15:31.514 --> 15:35.244
<b>You would've been spending the night at 
school if I hadn't come to get you, right?</b>

15:35.684 --> 15:37.664
<b>Why not make some friends?</b>

15:37.664 --> 15:39.974
<b>It's not that I don't make friends.</b>

15:39.974 --> 15:41.354
<b>It's that I <i>can't</i>.</b>

15:43.064 --> 15:46.324
<b>Well, you can count me, if you want.</b>

15:46.324 --> 15:48.894
<b>On your "friend counter."</b>

15:48.894 --> 15:52.574
<b>Isn't it nice to have somebody 
you can talk to about anything?</b>

15:52.574 --> 15:53.804
<b>And she's cute, too!</b>

15:55.524 --> 15:58.514
<b>I've never had a friend, 
so I wouldn't know.</b>

15:58.514 --> 16:00.394
<b>You're such a contrarian.</b>

16:00.394 --> 16:03.304
<b>I don't know how you 
got along with Siesta-san.</b>

16:03.724 --> 16:06.314
<b>We never really did get along.</b>

16:06.314 --> 16:08.854
<b>We would have a fight 
at least  every three days.</b>

16:08.854 --> 16:12.064
<b>Would you be the first 
to apologize when it happened?</b>

16:12.064 --> 16:14.144
<b>Most of the time.</b>

16:14.144 --> 16:18.074
<b>But sometimes, I'd get stubborn 
and not talk to her for a week.</b>

16:18.414 --> 16:19.654
<b>And then?</b>

16:19.934 --> 16:22.334
<b>She'd start to freak out.</b>

16:22.334 --> 16:24.374
<b>Siesta-san's that cute?</b>

16:24.654 --> 16:27.354
<b>And then when I'd go to talk to her again,</b>

16:27.354 --> 16:30.754
<b>she'd look relieved 
for a single instant, and then...</b>

16:31.084 --> 16:34.924
<b>She'd go back to looking upset 
and say, "Are you stupid?"</b>

16:34.924 --> 16:36.574
<b>Yup, that's right.</b>

16:36.574 --> 16:37.434
<b>Good work.</b>

16:37.434 --> 16:39.834
<b>You'd get an A grade in Siesta-isms.</b>

16:41.504 --> 16:46.644
<b>You know, you look happy 
when you talk about her.</b>

16:48.064 --> 16:52.444
<b>She was all you really wanted, wasn't she?</b>

16:53.774 --> 16:54.974
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

16:55.504 --> 16:58.444
<b>I was alone before I met her, too.</b>

16:59.674 --> 17:02.204
<b>You're a nice guy.</b>

17:03.134 --> 17:05.454
<b>But it's no good.</b>

17:05.864 --> 17:08.544
<b>Even when I'm talking 
to my friends in class,</b>

17:08.544 --> 17:10.964
<b>or when you're trying to cheer me up,</b>

17:11.294 --> 17:14.674
<b>I can't get the sight of it 
out of my head.</b>

17:14.974 --> 17:18.004
<b>And it's not just Siesta-san.</b>

17:18.534 --> 17:23.064
<b>I've hurt so many other innocent 
people with my own hands...</b>

17:18.534 --> 17:21.684
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting. Huh? Where's Nagi?</b>

17:21.684 --> 17:24.144
<b>She said to leave without her.</b>

17:32.024 --> 17:32.934
<b>So gloomy.</b>

17:33.234 --> 17:34.984
<b>Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?</b>

17:36.274 --> 17:37.734
<b>Listen to me, Natsunagi.</b>

17:37.734 --> 17:40.494
<b>It's still my turn to be angry.</b>

17:40.494 --> 17:43.164
<b>Huh? This isn't your kink?</b>

17:43.614 --> 17:46.834
<b>I-I-I-I'll kill you twice!</b>

17:48.224 --> 17:49.394
<b>A long time ago...</b>

17:50.294 --> 17:54.504
<b>When I was really down and depressed...</b>

17:54.894 --> 17:57.204
<b>Siesta slapped me on the back.</b>

17:58.114 --> 18:01.634
<b>So I'll always be there 
to slap you on the back, too,</b>

18:02.114 --> 18:03.884
<b>and hold your hand.</b>

18:05.654 --> 18:09.144
<b>All you did was run your fingertip 
down my back.</b>

18:09.944 --> 18:12.214
<b>You can get as depressed 
as you want right now.</b>

18:12.874 --> 18:16.554
<b>You can order takeout 
and stress eat as much as you want.</b>

18:16.554 --> 18:20.614
<b>Or curse the unfairness of it all using 
as much foul language as you want.</b>

18:21.224 --> 18:24.534
<b>If that still won't wash away your guilt,</b>

18:24.534 --> 18:26.244
<b>then I'll carry half of it.</b>

18:26.664 --> 18:29.864
<b>I couldn't save her then, either.</b>

18:30.494 --> 18:36.004
<b>So the least I can do 
is carry some of your pain.</b>

18:36.854 --> 18:38.084
<b>Kimizuka...</b>

18:38.924 --> 18:41.254
<b>Well, uh, you know...</b>

18:41.574 --> 18:45.194
<b>I feel like once I say this, 
I'll never escape it, but...</b>

18:46.174 --> 18:49.014
<b>I'm used to girls being mean to me!</b>

18:53.934 --> 18:57.774
<b>What? Why are you
sharing your fetish now?</b>

18:58.314 --> 19:01.224
<b>Hey, I'm trying to make you feel better!</b>

19:01.224 --> 19:04.604
<b>You're cheering me up by confessing 
that you're a masochist?</b>

19:04.604 --> 19:05.714
<b>That's crazy.</b>

19:05.714 --> 19:08.034
<b>You're more messed up than I thought!</b>

19:08.594 --> 19:10.564
<b>I was kidding...</b>

19:10.564 --> 19:13.004
<b>I just wanted to make you laugh...</b>

19:13.004 --> 19:15.504
<b>It's not actually my fetish...</b>

19:19.174 --> 19:20.694
<b>You're so dumb.</b>

19:22.644 --> 19:24.704
<b>You really are so dumb.</b>

19:26.864 --> 19:28.514
<b>Which of us is?</b>

19:31.624 --> 19:33.724
<b>You've been holding it in for so long.</b>

19:51.154 --> 19:54.094
<b>Now that you've stopped crying,</b>

19:54.094 --> 19:57.374
<b>let's start talking about that "mistake" 
Noches was referring to.</b>

19:57.744 --> 20:00.384
<b>Do you have any ideas?</b>

20:00.384 --> 20:02.314
<b>No, none.</b>

20:02.974 --> 20:09.694
<b>When Siesta was alive, 
she said that "past" was the truth.</b>

20:09.694 --> 20:12.894
<b>But something in it was wrong.</b>

20:13.294 --> 20:18.524
<b>Which means that when she was alive, 
Siesta made a mistake, maybe?</b>

20:18.524 --> 20:23.024
<b>But would Siesta-san make a mistake?</b>

20:23.024 --> 20:24.574
<b>True...</b>

20:24.574 --> 20:29.154
<b>Maybe it's fastest to talk 
to the people involved?</b>

20:29.684 --> 20:34.284
<b>There's me and Siesta, then you. Who else?</b>

20:34.284 --> 20:40.584
<b>Char... But if she didn't say anything then,
 nothing must've occurred to her.</b>

20:40.584 --> 20:42.294
<b>Maybe our enemies, then?</b>

20:42.294 --> 20:44.154
<b>SPES, huh?</b>

20:44.154 --> 20:47.304
<b>But then how would we talk to them?</b>

20:53.394 --> 20:54.304
<b>Hel.</b>

20:55.684 --> 20:59.934
<b>But Siesta sealed Hel away inside me, right?</b>

20:59.934 --> 21:01.634
<b>We're going to call her out?</b>

21:02.224 --> 21:04.754
<b>But then she'll have 
sealed her away for nothing—</b>

21:04.754 --> 21:05.484
<b>One year.</b>

21:07.544 --> 21:10.404
<b>She spent one year persuading her.</b>

21:11.004 --> 21:12.704
<b>I'm sure it'll be okay.</b>

21:13.474 --> 21:16.204
<b>But her...</b>

21:16.524 --> 21:18.334
<b>I heard what you were saying.</b>

21:19.324 --> 21:20.834
<b>If you're going to summon Hel,</b>

21:21.134 --> 21:23.014
<b>please leave it to me.</b>

21:24.814 --> 21:27.384
<b>So? Why are we in my house?</b>

21:27.384 --> 21:32.094
<b>This was the closest place where it 
seemed safe to make a lot of noise.</b>

21:32.094 --> 21:35.474
<b>I didn't say anything about it 
being okay to make a lot of noise...</b>

21:37.514 --> 21:42.544
<b>Is it okay for a detective to ask 
for help from a client, anyway?</b>

21:42.544 --> 21:45.344
<b>You really are an idiot, Kimihiko.</b>

21:45.734 --> 21:48.234
<b>Siesta-sama would have said</b>

21:48.744 --> 21:52.994
<b>that it's okay to do anything to 
protect your client's interests.</b>

21:54.144 --> 21:56.304
<b>You're right.</b>

21:58.654 --> 22:00.244
<b>Noches-san.</b>

22:00.534 --> 22:05.354
<b>How can I meet Hel... the other me?</b>

22:09.654 --> 22:12.884
<b>We'll summon her into that mirror.</b>

22:16.194 --> 22:17.144
<b>Hold this.</b>

22:17.544 --> 22:21.314
<b>And then stare at yourself in the mirror.</b>

22:21.314 --> 22:22.934
<b>Mirrors facing each other?</b>

22:22.934 --> 22:26.194
<b>There are sayings about
mirrors facing each other.</b>

22:26.194 --> 22:29.734
<b>They say a pair of mirrors 
can summon a devil.</b>

22:29.734 --> 22:33.194
<b>That they can show 
the past and the future.</b>

22:34.234 --> 22:36.074
<b>It's not difficult.</b>

22:36.404 --> 22:42.084
<b>If you wish to see her, the slightest 
chance will bring Hel to you.</b>

22:42.584 --> 22:47.834
<b>So just keep looking 
at yourself in the mirror.</b>

23:20.414 --> 23:21.744
<b>Natsunagi?</b>

23:24.654 --> 23:26.254
<b>It's been a long time.</b>

23:32.354 --> 23:34.114
<b>Master.</b>

23:35.014 --> 23:40.014
EPISODE 2: 
A STORY OF THAT DAY NO ONE KNOWS
